# AI Text Generator

## Project Overview

AI Text Generator is a web-based application that generates text based on a user-provided prompt. The application uses the GPT-Neo 125M pre-trained language model from EleutherAI through the Hugging Face Transformers library.

The application provides a simple and interactive interface built with Streamlit, allowing users to enter a prompt and receive AI-generated text.

## Features

- User-friendly text input interface
- AI-based text generation
- Pre-trained GPT-Neo 125M language model
- Interactive web interface using Streamlit
- Configurable text generation parameters
- Real-time generation of text based on user prompts

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- Hugging Face Transformers
- PyTorch
- GPT-Neo 125M

## Model Used

**Model:** EleutherAI GPT-Neo 125M

GPT-Neo is a transformer-based language model developed by EleutherAI. It can generate natural-language text by predicting the continuation of a given prompt.

